+| Migration-isolation negative tests | Prove the production isolation CLI rejects cross-linking, bundle/defaults/Keychain collisions, and release-script substitution | `make test-migration-isolation LEGACY_ROOT=/path/to/legacy-v0.1.0` | Disposable fixture copies under the system temporary directory; removed on exit |
 
